      "writtenOn": "2022-09-26T08:05:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For consistency with other flags, and better rollback safety, it would be better to have CONFIG_ACTIVELY_PREFER_BAD_WIFI_VERSION which would be the minimum version number to enable the feature; and read it with DeviceConfigUtils.isFeatureEnabled\n\nHere you could use `isFeatureEnabled(namespace, flag, isAtLeastU() || configActivelyPrefersBadWifi)` to get the same behavior (default-enable the feature if U+ or enabled via overlay)",
